 "text": "Hello, how are things going? You shouldn't feel guilty. Take short walking breaks every  hour, and make them entirely for being outside, not for work. Also, try standing up and walking around the room as you finish each section. It feels like a shorter break than going outside. Grab a drink, walk to the kitchen, and do a few squats. Anything to keep your legs and back from getting too stiff. Definitely not. Spending time on social media during a break can make you feel like you' not taking a proper break at all. Take short walking breaks every hour, and make them entirely for being outside. standing up and walking around the room as you finish each section feels like a shorter break than going outside.",
